    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d118">

                <pb facs="0253" n="87" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg87"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/2669</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Reinsch to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-13T20:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 13, 1917, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Republican troops began action against Imperialists early this morning. After ten
                    hours fighting the latter capitulated. Shan Hsun had already taken refuge in the
                    Dutch Legation. Stray bullets wounded three Americans.</p>
                <p>Tuan has already announced his Cabinet. It is to be composed; of strong men
                    representing three elements militarist, communications? [?] and Chin Pu Tang.
                    The southern Republicans are not represented. The latter are dissatisfied also
                    because of reactionary character of the cabinet.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
